WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:04.759
This is a real order, recorded end to end on the live AgenticOrg service.

2
00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:10.234
A merchant sets up a shop, a buyer's AI agent finds it and builds the order, and the

3
00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:14.079
buyer pays the merchant on the merchant's own payment page.

4
00:00:16.319 --> 00:00:21.335
The merchant opens Sell everywhere and picks their new shop, Kaveri Coffee.

5
00:00:21.335 --> 00:00:26.753
They have already saved the keys of their own Plural account, in sandbox mode for

6
00:00:26.753 --> 00:00:27.756
this recording.

7
00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:33.683
The shop has no Shopify store, so the merchant uploads a catalog file:

8
00:00:33.683 --> 00:00:36.465
two coffees, with prices and stock.

9
00:00:36.832 --> 00:00:42.271
Next come the policies buyers will see, and a flat shipping fee of forty-nine rupees

10
00:00:42.271 --> 00:00:43.825
for orders within India.

11
00:00:56.812 --> 00:01:00.309
Then the limits every AI agent must stay within:

12
00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:05.336
the largest order, the most per day, and the most items in one order.

13
00:01:05.336 --> 00:01:07.230
Nothing is set by default.

14
00:01:08.961 --> 00:01:14.442
For payment, AgenticOrg tests the merchant's Plural keys, and the merchant chooses

15
00:01:14.442 --> 00:01:17.383
to take payment in their own Plural account.

16
00:01:17.383 --> 00:01:20.124
AgenticOrg never holds the buyer's money.

17
00:01:20.491 --> 00:01:26.727
Last, the merchant names the shop on the network, accepts the terms, and turns Sell

18
00:01:26.727 --> 00:01:27.779
everywhere on.

19
00:01:30.627 --> 00:01:36.215
Turning it on enrols the shop with Grantex, which verifies the catalog, prices and

20
00:01:36.215 --> 00:01:40.985
stock, and publishes the shop's signed profile at its own web address.

21
00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:52.848
A few minutes later, the web address has its certificate, and everything is live.

22
00:01:52.848 --> 00:01:58.072
Buyers can reach the shop from AI apps such as ChatGPT and Claude, from the

23
00:01:58.072 --> 00:02:03.853
AgenticOrg bot on Telegram, and on the open web, and they pay on the merchant's own

24
00:02:03.853 --> 00:02:04.689
Plural page.

25
00:02:07.814 --> 00:02:13.817
Now the buyer's side. A buyer asks their AI assistant for two packs of South Indian

26
00:02:13.817 --> 00:02:19.819
filter coffee, delivered to Bengaluru. The assistant is connected to the AgenticOrg

27
00:02:19.819 --> 00:02:23.146
MCP server, and every call shown here is live.

28
00:02:23.516 --> 00:02:28.682
It lists the shops on the network and searches them, and finds the merchant's filter

29
00:02:28.682 --> 00:02:31.204
coffee at four hundred and twenty rupees.

30
00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:37.071
It opens a checkout for two packs, then adds the buyer's name and delivery address.

31
00:02:37.071 --> 00:02:42.281
The shop offers its flat shipping rate, and the total comes to eight hundred and

32
00:02:42.281 --> 00:02:43.518
eighty-nine rupees.

33
00:02:43.917 --> 00:02:47.704
The checkout is ready, so the agent asks to complete it.

34
00:02:47.704 --> 00:02:53.316
AgenticOrg checks the order against the merchant's limits and the verified catalog,

35
00:02:53.316 --> 00:02:58.185
records the decision, and returns a link to the merchant's payment page.

36
00:02:58.185 --> 00:03:00.348
The agent cannot pay on its own.

37
00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:08.159
The buyer opens the link. This is a Plural checkout under the merchant's own

38
00:03:08.159 --> 00:03:11.083
account, and the buyer pays with a test card.

39
00:03:52.197 --> 00:03:58.259
Plural sends the buyer back. AgenticOrg confirms the payment with Plural, and the

40
00:03:58.259 --> 00:03:59.680
order is confirmed.

41
00:04:08.444 --> 00:04:13.540
On the merchant's Orders page, the paid order appears with its items, the amount,

42
00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:18.700
and the delivery details the buyer gave. The merchant's administrators also get an

43
00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.216
email, and the merchant ships the order.

44
00:04:25.082 --> 00:04:28.487
That is the whole flow. The merchant set up once.

45
00:04:28.487 --> 00:04:34.254
A buyer's AI agent found the shop and built the order within the merchant's limits.

46
00:04:34.254 --> 00:04:37.102
And the buyer paid the merchant directly.

47
00:04:37.102 --> 00:04:40.229
The guides in this section explain each step.

